    {
        "id": 19,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_340_shwaz_2#2\")]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_340_shwaz_2#2"
    },
    {
        "id": 20,
        "raw": "[name=\"黑\"]   你果然会来这里，小姐。",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "黑",
        "content": "你果然会来这里，小姐。"
    },
    {
        "id": 21,
        "raw": "[Dialog]",
        "type": "dialog_marker"
    },
    {
        "id": 22,
        "raw": "[Character]",
        "type": "character"
    },
    {
        "id": 23,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_348_ceylon_4#5\",fadetime=1,block=true)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_348_ceylon_4#5",
        "fadetime": "1,block=true"
    },
    {
        "id": 24,
        "raw": "[Delay(time=1)]",
        "type": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "id": 25,
        "raw": "[name=\"锡兰\"]   黑......",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "锡兰",
        "content": "黑......"
    },
    {
        "id": 26,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_348_ceylon_4#2\",name2=\"char_340_shwaz_2#2\",focus=2)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_348_ceylon_4#2",
        "name2": "char_340_shwaz_2#2",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "id": 27,
        "raw": "[name=\"黑\"]   你一定会来这里。在被克洛宁拒绝以后，你想用广播塔散布信息，让全城人听到你的报告。",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "黑",
        "content": "你一定会来这里。在被克洛宁拒绝以后，你想用广播塔散布信息，让全城人听到你的报告。"
    },
    {
        "id": 28,
        "raw": "[name=\"黑\"]   这行不通，小姐，这只会带来更大的混乱。",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "黑",
        "content": "这行不通，小姐，这只会带来更大的混乱。"
    },
    {
        "id": 29,
        "raw": "[name=\"黑\"]   也许你讨厌你的父亲，也讨厌这个城市，但老爷已经付出得够多了。黑曜石节和这个城市会因此分崩离析。",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "黑",
        "content": "也许你讨厌你的父亲，也讨厌这个城市，但老爷已经付出得够多了。黑曜石节和这个城市会因此分崩离析。"
    },
    {
        "id": 30,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_348_ceylon_4#2\",name2=\"char_340_shwaz_2#2\",focus=1)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_348_ceylon_4#2",
        "name2": "char_340_shwaz_2#2",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "id": 31,
        "raw": "[name=\"锡兰\"]   我知道我的报告会引起轩然大波，也会引发许多后果，但大家都有权知道真相。",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "锡兰",
        "content": "我知道我的报告会引起轩然大波，也会引发许多后果，但大家都有权知道真相。"
    },
    {
        "id": 32,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_348_ceylon_4#2\",name2=\"char_340_shwaz_2#2\",focus=2)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_348_ceylon_4#2",
        "name2": "char_340_shwaz_2#2",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "id": 33,
        "raw": "[name=\"黑\"]   我知道老爷的过错。老爷为了这座城市做了很多不好的事情，只是没有这些事，根本不会有汐斯塔。",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "黑",
        "content": "我知道老爷的过错。老爷为了这座城市做了很多不好的事情，只是没有这些事，根本不会有汐斯塔。"
    },
    {
        "id": 34,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_348_ceylon_4#2\",name2=\"char_340_shwaz_2#2\",focus=1)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_348_ceylon_4#2",
        "name2": "char_340_shwaz_2#2",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "id": 35,
        "raw": "[name=\"锡兰\"]   这次完全不一样！",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "锡兰",
        "content": "这次完全不一样！"
    },
    {
        "id": 36,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_348_ceylon_4#2\",name2=\"char_340_shwaz_2#2\",focus=2)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_348_ceylon_4#2",
        "name2": "char_340_shwaz_2#2",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "id": 37,
        "raw": "[name=\"黑\"]   如果小姐觉得不能解气的话，批评我就可以了，请不要做出些没法挽救的事情。",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "黑",
        "content": "如果小姐觉得不能解气的话，批评我就可以了，请不要做出些没法挽救的事情。"
    },
    {
        "id": 38,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_348_ceylon_4#2\",name2=\"char_340_shwaz_2#2\",focus=1)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_348_ceylon_4#2",
        "name2": "char_340_shwaz_2#2",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "id": 39,
        "raw": "[name=\"锡兰\"]   你......你是不是觉得我还在耍小孩子脾气？",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "锡兰",
        "content": "你......你是不是觉得我还在耍小孩子脾气？"
    },
    {
        "id": 40,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_348_ceylon_4#2\",name2=\"char_340_shwaz_2#2\",focus=2)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_348_ceylon_4#2",
        "name2": "char_340_shwaz_2#2",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "id": 41,
        "raw": "[name=\"黑\"]   不，小姐。我可以和你一起慢慢说服老爷，我保证。只是现在，请跟我回去。",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "黑",
        "content": "不，小姐。我可以和你一起慢慢说服老爷，我保证。只是现在，请跟我回去。"
    },
    {
        "id": 42,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_348_ceylon_4#2\",name2=\"char_340_shwaz_2#2\",focus=1)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_348_ceylon_4#2",
        "name2": "char_340_shwaz_2#2",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "id": 43,
        "raw": "[name=\"锡兰\"]   黑......别这么说话。",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "锡兰",
        "content": "黑......别这么说话。"
    },
    {
        "id": 44,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_348_ceylon_4#2\",name2=\"char_340_shwaz_2#2\",focus=2)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_348_ceylon_4#2",
        "name2": "char_340_shwaz_2#2",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "id": 45,
        "raw": "[name=\"黑\"]   我理解你和老爷之间有许多不快，但你应该先回家。",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "黑",
        "content": "我理解你和老爷之间有许多不快，但你应该先回家。"
    },
    {
        "id": 46,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_348_ceylon_4#2\",name2=\"char_340_shwaz_2#2\",focus=1)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_348_ceylon_4#2",
        "name2": "char_340_shwaz_2#2",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "id": 47,
        "raw": "[name=\"锡兰\"]   别这么说话！我知道你想让我和爸爸之间的关系缓和一些，但你能不能不要是现在这个样子！",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "锡兰",
        "content": "别这么说话！我知道你想让我和爸爸之间的关系缓和一些，但你能不能不要是现在这个样子！"
    },
    {
        "id": 48,
        "raw": "[name=\"锡兰\"]   为什么就不能像以前一样呢，就像以前一样，像朋友一样和我说话啊，黑！",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "锡兰",
        "content": "为什么就不能像以前一样呢，就像以前一样，像朋友一样和我说话啊，黑！"
    },
    {
        "id": 49,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_348_ceylon_4#2\",name2=\"char_340_shwaz_2#2\",focus=2)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_348_ceylon_4#2",
        "name2": "char_340_shwaz_2#2",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "id": 50,
        "raw": "[name=\"黑\"]   我只是道尔科斯家的仆人。",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "黑",
        "content": "我只是道尔科斯家的仆人。"
    },
    {
        "id": 51,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_348_ceylon_4#2\",name2=\"char_340_shwaz_2#2\",focus=1)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_348_ceylon_4#2",
        "name2": "char_340_shwaz_2#2",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "id": 52,
        "raw": "[name=\"锡兰\"]   我不想你这么说，黑。我不要听你这么说！怎么会变成这样的，你为什么会变成这个样子？",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "锡兰",
        "content": "我不想你这么说，黑。我不要听你这么说！怎么会变成这样的，你为什么会变成这个样子？"
    },
    {
        "id": 53,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_348_ceylon_4#2\",name2=\"char_340_shwaz_2#2\",focus=2)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_348_ceylon_4#2",
        "name2": "char_340_shwaz_2#2",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "id": 54,
        "raw": "[name=\"黑\"]   ......",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "黑",
        "content": "......"
    },
    {
        "id": 55,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"avg_npc_020\")]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_020"
    },
    {
        "id": 56,
        "raw": "[name=\"克洛宁的手下\"]   你还犹豫些什么？快把她抓起来啊？",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "克洛宁的手下",
        "content": "你还犹豫些什么？快把她抓起来啊？"
    },
    {
        "id": 57,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_340_shwaz_2#4\")]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_340_shwaz_2#4"
    },
    {
        "id": 58,
        "raw": "[name=\"黑\"]   ——她是道尔科斯家的女儿。别太僭越。",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "黑",
        "content": "——她是道尔科斯家的女儿。别太僭越。"
    },
    {
        "id": 59,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"avg_npc_020\")]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_020"
    },
    {
        "id": 60,
        "raw": "[name=\"克洛宁的手下\"]   但市长已经要你全力协助克洛宁先生了！你要看着她散布谣言，毁掉整个汐斯塔吗？",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "克洛宁的手下",
        "content": "但市长已经要你全力协助克洛宁先生了！你要看着她散布谣言，毁掉整个汐斯塔吗？"
    },
    {
        "id": 61,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_340_shwaz_2#2\")]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_340_shwaz_2#2"
    },
    {
        "id": 62,
        "raw": "[name=\"黑\"]   ......用用你的脑子。她一个人在这里，没有表现出哪怕一丁点的焦躁，甚至......",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "黑",
        "content": "......用用你的脑子。她一个人在这里，没有表现出哪怕一丁点的焦躁，甚至......"
    },
    {
        "id": 63,
        "raw": "[name=\"黑\"]   你觉得她真的想进入广播塔吗？",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "黑",
        "content": "你觉得她真的想进入广播塔吗？"
    },
    {
        "id": 64,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"avg_npc_020\")]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_020"
    },
    {
        "id": 65,
        "raw": "[name=\"克洛宁的手下\"]   什么？",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "克洛宁的手下",
        "content": "什么？"
    },
    {
        "id": 66,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_340_shwaz_2#2\")]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_340_shwaz_2#2"
    },
    {
        "id": 67,
        "raw": "[name=\"黑\"]   算了。",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "黑",
        "content": "算了。"
    },
    {
        "id": 68,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_348_ceylon_4#2\",name2=\"char_340_shwaz_2#2\",focus=2)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_348_ceylon_4#2",
        "name2": "char_340_shwaz_2#2",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "id": 69,
        "raw": "[name=\"黑\"]   小姐，你在把自己当成诱饵吸引我，对吗？",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "黑",
        "content": "小姐，你在把自己当成诱饵吸引我，对吗？"
    },
    {
        "id": 70,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_348_ceylon_4#4\",name2=\"char_340_shwaz_2#2\",focus=1)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_348_ceylon_4#4",
        "name2": "char_340_shwaz_2#2",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "id": 71,
        "raw": "[name=\"锡兰\"]   ......你还是了解我的。",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "锡兰",
        "content": "......你还是了解我的。"
    },
    {
        "id": 72,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_348_ceylon_4#4\",name2=\"char_340_shwaz_2#2\",focus=2)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_348_ceylon_4#4",
        "name2": "char_340_shwaz_2#2",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "id": 73,
        "raw": "[name=\"黑\"]   我不敢这么说，小姐。只不过你没有否认我的猜测，我可以下结论了。",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "黑",
        "content": "我不敢这么说，小姐。只不过你没有否认我的猜测，我可以下结论了。"
    },
    {
        "id": 74,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_348_ceylon_4#2\",name2=\"char_340_shwaz_2#2\",focus=1)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_348_ceylon_4#2",
        "name2": "char_340_shwaz_2#2",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "id": 75,
        "raw": "[name=\"锡兰\"]   现在这个时候，罗德岛应该已经出现在市政厅了。",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "锡兰",
        "content": "现在这个时候，罗德岛应该已经出现在市政厅了。"
    },
    {
        "id": 76,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"avg_npc_020\")]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_020"
    },
    {
        "id": 77,
        "raw": "[name=\"克洛宁的手下\"]   什、什么？这可不在我们的计划里啊！市政厅那边现在是什么情况？",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "克洛宁的手下",
        "content": "什、什么？这可不在我们的计划里啊！市政厅那边现在是什么情况？"
    },
    {
        "id": 78,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_348_ceylon_4#2\",name2=\"char_340_shwaz_2#5\",focus=2)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_348_ceylon_4#2",
        "name2": "char_340_shwaz_2#5",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "id": 79,
        "raw": "[name=\"黑\"]   我觉得，那群酒囊饭袋，现在大概正被打得四处乱窜。",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "黑",
        "content": "我觉得，那群酒囊饭袋，现在大概正被打得四处乱窜。"
    },
    {
